### Article 40. Termination of the employment contract at the initiative of the employer

An employment contract concluded for an indefinite period, as well as a fixed-term employment contract before the expiration of its validity period, may be terminated by the employer only in the following cases:

1) changes in the organization of production and work, including liquidation, reorganization, bankruptcy or repurposing of an enterprise, institution, organization, reduction in the number or staff of employees;

