__

3. The business entity may hire employees for their further performance of work in Ukraine for natural persons on the basis of a contract concluded between the business entity and the natural person on the provision of services.

4. A business entity is prohibited from sending employees to workplaces with an employer in which:

1) the number (staff) of employees was reduced during the year;

2) the standard of the number of employees of the main professions involved in the technological processes of the main production has not been observed;

3) employees are engaged to perform work in harmful, dangerous and difficult working conditions, as well as work in the main professions of the technological process of the main production.

