development of measures for social protection of employees who are released from enterprises, institutions and organizations at the initiative of employers;

the work of coordinating committees to promote the employment of the population;

consultations on attracting and using foreign labor in Ukraine;

management of mandatory state social insurance in accordance with legislation, in particular in the formation of the draft budget of the Fund for mandatory state social insurance of Ukraine in case of unemployment;

development and updating of professional standards (qualification characteristics), promotion of the development of the system of training, retraining and advanced training of employees, ensuring their proper quality and employment of graduates of professional (vocational and technical), professional pre-higher and higher education institutions;

