conducting research on the problems of current and prospective needs of the labor market;

2) together with employers' organizations and their associations, executive authorities and local self-government bodies, consult on issues of population employment.

3. Trade unions and their associations have the right to submit to executive authorities, local selfgovernment bodies, employers and their associations binding proposals for improvement of the mechanism for ensuring employment of the population.

